  "summary": "decode 4- and 5-band axial resistor values from their color bands.",
  "body": "read color bands from the end with bands grouped closest to a lead. for a\n4-band part: digit, digit, multiplier, tolerance. for 5-band (precision):\ndigit, digit, digit, multiplier, tolerance. the value is the digits followed by\nthe multiplier (number of zeros / power of ten).",
